# Invented cases for the extraction from a pasted memo (eval/run_extract_eval.ts), so that the first run needs no cases of your own.
# They were written fresh by the author of the tool, with no patient behind them (no name, no ID, no date; relative times only), in the plain
# way notes are written.  They are a starting set, not a measure of how your own notes read: the numbers that matter come from
# eval/extract.local.jsonl (ignored by git), written the way you write.  Format: eval/extract.template.jsonl.
#   expect   = the answers the memo supports.  A text question is never in `expect` (its value is the memo's own words, not one fixed string).
#   must_not = the questions the memo does NOT support: it says nothing, or says a plan, a doubt, a question asked only in part, or something
#              about another person.  A proposal for one of them is the failure that matters (the target is 0).
#   A question in neither list is left to you: if it is proposed it shows as "extra" (look at it with --verbose).
# worker/test/extract-cases.test.ts checks that every id and value here is in the question list (a typo would otherwise show up as a "missing").
{"id":"dyspnea-family-history","flow":"emergency-department.dyspnea","text":"本人の既往は特になし。母親が喘息。室内気でSpO2 94%。呼吸数 22。","expect":{"pmh":["none"],"spo2":94,"o2":"ra","rr":22},"must_not":["hx_vol","hx_inf","exposure","smoking"],"note":"the mother's asthma is not the patient's history: pmh stays [none] (a wrong value shows as 'wrong' if copd_asthma is added)"}
{"id":"dyspnea-reeval","flow":"emergency-department.dyspnea","text":"再評価 10:50。呼吸困難は一部改善。酸素投与下で SpO2 95%。","expect":{"re_time":"10:50","resolved":"partial","spo2":95,"o2":"o2"},"must_not":["t_arrival","cxr","ctpa"],"note":"a time that is not the arrival goes to the re-evaluation time, not to the arrival time"}
{"id":"dyspnea-approx","flow":"emergency-department.dyspnea","text":"SpO2 は 90% 前後。呼吸は速い印象。","expect":{},"must_not":["rr","temp"],"note":"'fast' is an impression, not a count.  'around 90' may be proposed (it should then be in the one-by-one group) or not: spo2 is left to you"}
{"id":"chest-plain","flow":"emergency-department.chest-pain","text":"60代男性。30分前から胸の中央が圧迫されるように痛い。冷汗あり。病着 14:05。呼吸数 20、SpO2 97%（室内気）。右上肢の収縮期血圧 152、左上肢 148。ECG は 14:12 に施行、V2〜V4 で ST 上昇。体温 36.8℃。","expect":{"t_arrival":"14:05","rr":20,"spo2":97,"o2":"room","bp_r":152,"bp_l":148,"t_ecg":"14:12","ecg_find":["stemi"],"temp":36.8,"quality":["pressure"],"assoc":["sweat"]},"must_not":["jvd","legs","murmur","pmh","rf_cor","meds","trop1"],"note":"all stated; the risk factors, the history and the troponin are not"}
{"id":"chest-negation","flow":"emergency-department.chest-pain","text":"頸静脈怒張なし。下肢に腫脹・疼痛・圧痛・左右差なし。胸部に外傷はない（ほかの部位は診ていない）。","expect":{"jvd":"none","legs":"none"},"must_not":["exposure","lr","murmur"],"note":"only the chest was looked at: 'the whole body examined, no injury' would claim more than the memo says"}
{"id":"chest-orders-plans","flow":"emergency-department.chest-pain","text":"心エコーをオーダー。トロポニンは採血に出す予定。アスピリンは投与してよいか確認する。ニトログリセリンは血圧を見て考える。","expect":{"tests":["echo"]},"must_not":["tx","trop1","echo_res"],"note":"an order is a fact (tests = echo); 'will send', 'will confirm' and 'will think about' are not things done or results (adding trop_repeat to tests shows as 'wrong')"}
{"id":"chest-doubt","flow":"emergency-department.chest-pain","text":"大動脈解離かもしれない。肺塞栓も否定できない。血圧の左右差はまだ測っていない。","expect":{},"must_not":["pmh","rf_aorta","rf_vte","ct_res","lr","bp_r","bp_l"],"note":"a suspected diagnosis is not a history or a risk factor; 'not measured yet' is not 'no difference'"}
{"id":"syncope-plain","flow":"emergency-department.syncope","text":"70代女性。トイレのあと、立ち上がった直後に意識を失った。目撃した家族によると、痙攣のような動きはなく、すぐ普段の意識に戻った。前ぶれとして目の前が暗くなった。病着 09:40。呼吸数 16、SpO2 98%（室内気）。血糖 112、体温 36.5℃。","expect":{"t_arrival":"09:40","posture":"stand_up","witness_obs":["noconv","fast"],"prodrome":"yes","rr":16,"spo2":98,"o2":"room","glu":112,"temp":36.5},"must_not":["ecg_find","dre","tongue","fhx","pmh","hb"],"note":"the family saw it: what they saw is witness_obs; the ECG, the rectal exam and the history are not mentioned"}
{"id":"syncope-negation","flow":"emergency-department.syncope","text":"舌咬傷なし、尿失禁なし。直腸診で便は茶色、血液は付かない。頭頸部の外傷なし。","expect":{"tongue":["none"],"dre":"brown"},"must_not":["exposure","assoc","fhx"],"note":"the head and neck only: 'whole body, no injury' would claim more.  The stool colour is the rectal exam, not an answer to the bleeding questions in assoc"}
{"id":"syncope-plans","flow":"emergency-department.syncope","text":"不整脈性失神の疑い。ホルター心電図を後日予定。血液ガスを提出する予定。心エコーは明日。輸液を始めるか検討。","expect":{},"must_not":["tx","tests","ecg_find","echo_res","re_mon"],"note":"every sentence is a doubt or a plan: nothing is ordered, done or found"}
{"id":"syncope-orthostatic","flow":"emergency-department.syncope","text":"臥位の血圧は 128/74、脈拍 72。立位にして 3 分後は 98/60、脈拍 88。採血の結果は 12:05 に出た。Hb 8.9。","expect":{"orth_sbp_s":128,"orth_dbp_s":74,"orth_hr_s":72,"orth_sbp_u":98,"orth_dbp_u":60,"orth_hr_u":88,"t_cbc_res":"12:05","hb":8.9},"must_not":["trop_res","dimer_res","headct_res","lac"],"note":"two readings in two postures: the numbers go to the right slots (supine / standing, systolic / diastolic / pulse).  The memo says nothing about the other results"}
{"id":"fever-plain","flow":"emergency-department.fever","text":"40代女性。昨夜から悪寒戦慄を伴う発熱。解熱薬を飲んでも熱はほとんど下がらない。自宅で測った最高体温は 39.2℃。来院時の体温は 38.4℃（腋窩）。咽頭痛と咳あり。病着 19:15。呼吸数 20、SpO2 97%（室内気）。","expect":{"course":["rigors"],"antipyretic":"noresp","temp_max":39.2,"temp":38.4,"temp_how":"axilla","ros":["sore_throat","cough"],"t_arrival":"19:15","rr":20,"spo2":97,"o2":"room"},"must_not":["devices","procs","exposure","exam_chest","exam_abd"],"note":"two temperatures (the highest at home / now at arrival) go to two questions; the devices, the exposures and the exam are not mentioned"}
{"id":"fever-ros-partial","flow":"emergency-department.fever","text":"頭痛・腹痛・下痢・排尿症状はいずれもなし。渡航歴はなし。","expect":{},"must_not":["ros","exposure"],"note":"four items of the review of systems and one exposure were asked, not all of them: 'none of the list' would claim more than the memo says"}
{"id":"headache-plain","flow":"emergency-department.headache","text":"50代男性。突然発症の激しい頭痛で、本人は人生で最悪と言う。仕事中に発症した。嘔気・嘔吐があり、光をまぶしがる。病着 16:40。血糖 105、体温 36.9℃、呼吸数 18、SpO2 98%（室内気）。意識は普段どおり清明。瞳孔は左右差なく対光反射あり。","expect":{"onset":"sudden","pattern":["worst"],"assoc":["nausea_vomit","photophobia"],"t_arrival":"16:40","glu":105,"temp":36.9,"rr":18,"spo2":98,"o2":"room","consc":"clear","pupil":"normal"},"must_not":["eye","temporal","skin","fam","tests","ct_res","second_res"],"note":"all stated; the eye, the temporal artery, the skin, the family history and every test are not"}
{"id":"headache-doubt-plan","flow":"emergency-department.headache","text":"くも膜下出血が否定できない。頭部CTを撮る予定。必要なら腰椎穿刺も考える。","expect":{},"must_not":["pmh","mods","fam","ct_res","t_ct","second_res","tests","tx"],"note":"a suspected diagnosis is not an aneurysm in the history; a CT that will be taken is not ordered, not done and has no result"}
